36:19.440 --> 36:25.900
A version-controlled repository is absolutely a less lossy projection than ordinary publication.

36:26.300 --> 36:34.640
It retains a much larger region of the history, preserving d sub zero through d sub n minus one as accessible objects, along with the metadata connecting them.

36:34.800 --> 36:36.780
