But it is a mistake to view it as a perfect immune archive.

36:46.320 --> 36:49.020
It is still just a different point on the spectrum of projections.

36:49.580 --> 36:56.880
And crucially, even within Git, even within software designed to remember, there are operators that permanently destroy history.

36:56.880 --> 37:00.260
Right. Any developer listening is probably nodding their head right now.

37:00.360 --> 37:04.180
Because even in Git, we have highly destructive operations that we use all the time.

37:04.260 --> 37:04.740
Oh, absolutely.

