39:05.380 --> 39:06.100
It's a feature.

39:06.560 --> 39:07.960
It is the defining feature.

39:08.480 --> 39:13.560
We have to return to the fundamental distinction between a historical construction and a state description.

39:14.100 --> 39:15.220
A draft history.

39:15.720 --> 39:19.220
The messy sequence of operators, the false starts, the overrides, the tiers.

39:19.600 --> 39:21.280
At 2 a.m. is a historical construction.

39:21.440 --> 39:24.200
To understand it, you have to literally walk the path.

39:24.480 --> 39:26.660
You have to experience this sequence of time and struggle.

39:26.660 --> 39:30.020
The published paper, however, is a state description.

39:30.540 --> 39:31.640
You don't need to walk the path.

39:31.900 --> 39:33.200
You just need the final facts.

39:33.500 --> 39:37.400
You just need the unordered set of constraints and claims currently in force.

39:37.640 --> 39:40.360
Let me try to break down the grand trade-off here for you listening,

39:40.480 --> 39:43.700
because this is honestly the profound takeaway from all of this math.

39:44.620 --> 39:51.440
Imagine if every single time you wanted to use Pythagoras' theorem to build a house or solve a math problem,

39:51.620 --> 39:55.420
you couldn't just look up a squared plus b squared equals c squared.

39:55.520 --> 39:56.280
That would be a nightmare.

